{"text": "True I am nervous, very nervous. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But why will you say. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That I am mad. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My illness has made. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My senses sharper. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Not weaker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Above all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My hearing became. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Very sharp. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Listen and see. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How calmly I can tell you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The whole story. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is impossible. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To say. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How the idea first entered my brain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I loved the old man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he had never done anything wrong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I did not want. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I think. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was his eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had the eye of a vulture. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pale blue. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a thin film over it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whenever it looked at me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My blood ran cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So, little by little. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I made up my mind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To get rid of the eye forever.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "r", "u", "e", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "n", "e", "r", "v", "o", "u", "s", ",", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "n", "e", "r", "v", "o", "u", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "w", "h", "y", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "m", "a", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/",